# Fail fast on stalled Maven Central transfers instead of hanging until the
# CI job timeout (GitHub Actions ubuntu lanes have hit silent download stalls
# that burned the whole 20-minute budget). Socket reads idle for 2 minutes are
# aborted and retried by the resolver's retry handler; steady transfers of any
# size are unaffected. Maven Resolver 1.9.x (Maven 3.9.x) property names.
-Daether.connector.connectTimeout=30000
-Daether.connector.requestTimeout=120000
